{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようゴリラ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴリラはちょっとゴツいかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はね6時に起きました(*^｡^*)朝の薄暗い感じいいですよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"題名の筋肉痛なんだけど、筋肉痛好きなんです( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近思い出したの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃の話しなのだけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃よくアリについて行って、行方不明になることがよくあったみたいなのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと。中学生の時、潜水をお風呂でしたくてストローを鼻にさして息できるかなーっておもってたんだけど、見事にお湯がストローを通って鼻の中にはいってきたのー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出したから話してみました｡o@(･_･)@o｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログだとなんか話しやすいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番初めの欅って、書けない?の自己紹介の写真がでてきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう懐かしいな!( •̅_•̅ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHESNKGBCVFJ63QGT0BZNBX5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHESNMF4Y3P3SS79M6CNPJP0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレーしたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"志田愛佳"}],"source":"archive"}